.TH XD\-DEFAULTS 1 2026-10-18 XeonDesktop "XeonDesktop Manual"
.SH NAME
xd\-defaults \- Set Program Access and Defaults
.SH SYNOPSIS
.SY xd\-defaults
.YS
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B xd\-defaults
is Windows XP's Set Program Access and Defaults (Default Programs in the
Windows 7 Start menu): the default web browser, e-mail program and other
programs, one section per activity, as in XP's Custom configuration.
\(lqUse my current ...\(rq keeps what is set.
OK writes the choices through GIO, which other desktops' programs read
too.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/mimeapps.list
The default applications.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR xd\-folders (1),
.BR xdg\-mime (1)
